<BaseLayout title={strings.nav.about} description={strings.descriptions.about}>
  <h1>{strings.nav.about}</h1>
  <p class="prose">
    I'm Uğur Can Hatırlı, a first-year International Relations student at Galatasaray University.
  </p>
  <p class="prose">
    I completed the French-language preparatory programme at Galatasaray, then the
    English-language preparatory programme at Boğaziçi University, before returning to Galatasaray
    for International Relations.
  </p>
  <p class="prose">
    My current interests include political thought, European politics, philosophy, and research
    methods. These are developing interests rather than fixed research specialisations.
  </p>
  <p class="prose">Turkish is my first language. I also read, write, and work in English and French.</p>
  <p class="prose">This site collects a selection of my writing and notes.</p>
